# Project rules: Web scraper

- Check for an official API or data export first and tell me if one exists.
- Respect robots.txt and the site's terms. Wait at least 1 second between requests and send a descriptive User-Agent.
- Cache downloaded pages to a local folder and parse from the cache while developing.
- Keep all CSS selectors in one place at the top of the file.
- Use plain requests first. Ask before adding a headless browser.
- Don't collect personal data (emails, phone numbers, profiles) unless I explicitly ask and confirm it's allowed.
